{
    "title": "Local News: Headlines & Alerts",
    "description": "<b>Uncover Your Local World with Local News: Your Channel to Weather, Events, and Headlines</b>\r\n\r\nStay connected with your community and beyond with Local News, the premier news aggregator designed specifically for U.S. local news enthusiasts. With a focus on delivering the latest and most relevant local news, weather alerts, and events, Local News ensures you're always in the know about what's happening in your area.\r\n\r\nKey Features:\r\n\r\n<b>\u00b7 Personalized News Feed</b> \r\nDive into a rich array of local news categories tailored to your interests, including politics, crime, sports, entertainment, finance, health, and lifestyle. Our app aggregates trusted local news sources, giving you a comprehensive and customized local news experience.\r\n\r\n<b>\u00b7 Customized Push Notifications</b> \r\nNever miss an important local news story with our real-time, tailored push notifications. Get updates on breaking local news, community happenings, and international headlines that matter most to you.\r\n\r\n<b>\u00b7 Local Events & Weather Alerts</b> \r\nExplore local news, events, fairs, and festivals happening this weekend near you. Receive timely weather alerts to stay prepared, and enjoy video content that provides local insights and highlights. Connect with like-minded neighbors in the comments section.\r\n\r\n<b>\u00b7 Live Coverage & Viral Videos</b>\r\nDive into local stories with viral clips. Our new short video feature lets you experience news as it happens, immersing you in real-time events, trending entertainment gossip, and videos that match your interests.\r\n\r\nLocal News is your go-to source for engaging, comprehensive local coverage. Stay connected with the latest updates and happenings, all tailored to your interests.",
    "descriptionHTML": "<b>Uncover Your Local World with Local News: Your Channel to Weather, Events, and Headlines</b><br><br>Stay connected with your community and beyond with Local News, the premier news aggregator designed specifically for U.S. local news enthusiasts. With a focus on delivering the latest and most relevant local news, weather alerts, and events, Local News ensures you&#39;re always in the know about what&#39;s happening in your area.<br><br>Key Features:<br><br><b>\u00b7 Personalized News Feed</b> <br>Dive into a rich array of local news categories tailored to your interests, including politics, crime, sports, entertainment, finance, health, and lifestyle. Our app aggregates trusted local news sources, giving you a comprehensive and customized local news experience.<br><br><b>\u00b7 Customized Push Notifications</b> <br>Never miss an important local news story with our real-time, tailored push notifications. Get updates on breaking local news, community happenings, and international headlines that matter most to you.<br><br><b>\u00b7 Local Events &amp; Weather Alerts</b> <br>Explore local news, events, fairs, and festivals happening this weekend near you. Receive timely weather alerts to stay prepared, and enjoy video content that provides local insights and highlights. Connect with like-minded neighbors in the comments section.<br><br><b>\u00b7 Live Coverage &amp; Viral Videos</b><br>Dive into local stories with viral clips. Our new short video feature lets you experience news as it happens, immersing you in real-time events, trending entertainment gossip, and videos that match your interests.<br><br>Local News is your go-to source for engaging, comprehensive local coverage. Stay connected with the latest updates and happenings, all tailored to your interests.",
